<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Séance d'initiation – {{ seance.prenom }} {{ seance.nom }}</title>
    <style nonce="{{ csp_nonce('style') }}">
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #111;
            background: #e8e8ec;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* ── Barre de contrôle ── */
        .ctrl-bar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 52px;
            background: #18181c;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 24px;
            gap: 16px;
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        }

        .ctrl-back {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.15s;
        }
        .ctrl-back:hover { color: #fff; }
        .ctrl-back svg { flex-shrink: 0; }

        .ctrl-divider {
            width: 1px;
            height: 20px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .ctrl-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .ctrl-sub {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
        }

        .ctrl-spacer { flex: 1; }

        .ctrl-info {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
        }

        .ctrl-print-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            background: #e8720c;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 18px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.07em;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: background 0.15s;
        }
        .ctrl-print-btn:hover { background: #c96209; }

        /* ── Zone page ── */
        .page-shell {
            padding: 72px 24px 48px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        /* ── Page A4 ── */
        .page {
            width: 210mm;
            min-height: 297mm;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 16mm 16mm 14mm;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.22), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 14px;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* ── Filigrane ── */
        .page-watermark {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-35deg);
            font-size: 64pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            color: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            pointer-events: none;
            user-select: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* ── En-tête ── */
        .doc-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #e8720c;
        }

        .header-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .header-logo {
            height: 38px;
            width: auto;
        }

        .header-club-name {
            font-size: 15pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            color: #111;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .header-club-sport {
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            color: #e8720c;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .header-right {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .header-doc-num {
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #333;
        }

        .header-doc-date {
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            color: #888;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        /* ── Titre ── */
        .doc-title {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4px 0 2px;
        }

        .doc-title h1 {
            font-size: 13pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: #111;
            display: inline-block;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #111;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* ── Blocs ── */
        .doc-section {
            border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .doc-section-head {
            background: #f4f4f6;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d8d8;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
        }

        .doc-section-head-bar {
            width: 3px;
            height: 14px;
            background: #e8720c;
            border-radius: 2px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .doc-section-title {
            font-size: 7pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.13em;
            color: #555;
        }

        .doc-section-body {
            padding: 12px 14px;
        }

        /* ── Grille infos ── */
        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px 28px;
        }

        .info-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }

        .info-label {
            font-size: 7pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: #999;
        }

        .info-value {
            font-size: 11.5pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding-bottom: 3px;
            min-height: 22px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .sport-chip {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #fff5ed;
            border: 1.5px solid #e8720c;
            color: #c65a00;
            padding: 1px 9px;
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        /* ── Décharge ── */
        .disclaimer-text {
            font-size: 10pt;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .disclaimer-text strong {
            font-weight: 900;
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        }

        .disclaimer-note {
            font-size: 7pt;
            color: #bbb;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        /* ── Signatures ── */
        .sign-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 28px;
        }

        .sign-block { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }

        .sign-label {
            font-size: 7pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: #999;
        }

        .sign-area { height: 52px; border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa; }

        .sign-hint {
            font-size: 7pt;
            color: #ccc;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* ── Pied de page ── */
        .doc-footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 10px;
            border-top: 1px dashed #ddd;
        }

        .doc-footer-text {
            font-size: 7pt;
            color: #ccc;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* ── Mobile ── */
        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .page-shell { padding: 64px 0 32px; }

            .page {
                width: 100%;
                min-height: auto;
                padding: 20px 16px;
                box-shadow: none;
                border-radius: 0;
            }

            .page-watermark { display: none; }

            .ctrl-bar { padding: 0 14px; gap: 10px; }
            .ctrl-info { display: none; }
            .ctrl-sub  { display: none; }

            .doc-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; }
            .header-right { text-align: left; }

            .info-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }

            .sign-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }

            .doc-footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; align-items: flex-start; }
        }

        /* ── @media print ── */
        @media print {
            .ctrl-bar { display: none !important; }

            body { background: #fff; }

            .page-shell {
                padding: 0;
                display: block;
            }

            .page {
                width: 100%;
                min-height: auto;
                padding: 10mm 13mm 10mm;
                box-shadow: none;
            }

            .doc-section-head {
                background: #efefef !important;
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
                print-color-adjust: exact;
            }

            .sport-chip {
                background: transparent !important;
                color: #333 !important;
                border-color: #888 !important;
            }

            .doc-section-head-bar {
                background: #888 !important;
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
                print-color-adjust: exact;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="ctrl-bar">
        <a href="{{ path('admin_seance_essai_index') }}" class="ctrl-back">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline></svg>
            Retour
        </a>
        <div class="ctrl-divider"></div>
        <div>
            <div class="ctrl-label">{{ seance.prenom }} {{ seance.nom|upper }}</div>
            <div class="ctrl-sub">{{ seance.sport }} · {{ seance.dateSeance|date('d/m/Y') }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ctrl-spacer"></div>
        <span class="ctrl-info">Faire signer puis archiver</span>
        <a href="{{ path('admin_seance_essai_pdf', {id: seance.id}) }}" class="ctrl-print-btn" style="background:#3a3a42; text-decoration:none;">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
            Télécharger le PDF
        </a>
        <button id="btn-print" class="ctrl-print-btn">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 6 2 18 2 18 9"></polyline><path d="M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><rect x="6" y="14" width="12" height="8"></rect></svg>
            Imprimer
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="page-shell">
        <div class="page">

            <div class="page-watermark">CHM</div>

            {# ── En-tête ── #}
            <div class="doc-header">
                <div class="header-left">
                    <img src="{{ absolute_url(asset('images/favicon/icon2.png')) }}" alt="Logo CHM" class="header-logo">
                    <div>
                        <div class="header-club-name">CHM Saleux</div>
                        <div class="header-club-sport">Haltérophilie &amp; Musculation</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="header-right">
                    <div class="header-doc-num">Fiche n°{{ seance.id }}</div>
                    <div class="header-doc-date">{{ seance.createdAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ── Titre ── #}
            <div class="doc-title">
                <h1>Fiche de séance d'initiation</h1>
            </div>

            {# ── Informations participant ── #}
            <div class="doc-section">
                <div class="doc-section-head">
                    <div class="doc-section-head-bar"></div>
                    <span class="doc-section-title">Informations du participant</span>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-section-body">
                    <div class="info-grid">
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Nom</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.nom|upper }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Prénom</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.prenom }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Date de naissance</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.dateNaissance ? seance.dateNaissance|date('d/m/Y') : '&nbsp;'|raw }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Téléphone</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.telephone ?: '&nbsp;'|raw }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Email</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.email ?: '&nbsp;'|raw }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Adresse</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.adresse ?: '&nbsp;'|raw }}</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ── Détails séance ── #}
            <div class="doc-section">
                <div class="doc-section-head">
                    <div class="doc-section-head-bar"></div>
                    <span class="doc-section-title">Détails de la séance</span>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-section-body">
                    <div class="info-grid">
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Sport pratiqué</span>
                            <span class="info-value"><span class="sport-chip">{{ seance.sport }}</span></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Date</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.dateSeance|date('d/m/Y') }}</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ── Responsable légal (si mineur) ── #}
            {% if seance.responsableNom %}
            <div class="doc-section">
                <div class="doc-section-head">
                    <div class="doc-section-head-bar"></div>
                    <span class="doc-section-title">Responsable légal (pratiquant mineur)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-section-body">
                    <div class="info-grid">
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Nom &amp; prénom</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.responsableNom }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Lien de parenté</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.responsableLien ?: '&nbsp;'|raw }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Téléphone</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.responsableTelephone ?: '&nbsp;'|raw }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-field">
                            <span class="info-label">Email</span>
                            <span class="info-value">{{ seance.responsableEmail ?: '&nbsp;'|raw }}</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            {# ── Décharge ── #}
            <div class="doc-section">
                <div class="doc-section-head">
                    <div class="doc-section-head-bar"></div>
                    <span class="doc-section-title">Décharge de responsabilité</span>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-section-body">
                    <p class="disclaimer-text">
                        Je soussigné(e) <strong>{{ seance.prenom }} {{ seance.nom|upper }}</strong>
                        déclare avoir été informé(e) des risques liés à la pratique de
                        <strong>{{ seance.sport }}</strong>
                        et certifie ne pas avoir de contre-indication médicale à la pratique d'une activité
                        physique intense. Je dégage le club <strong>CHM Saleux</strong> et ses encadrants
                        de toute responsabilité en cas d'accident ou de blessure survenu(e) pendant cette
                        séance d'initiation, résultant de ma propre négligence ou du non-respect des
                        consignes de sécurité. Je reconnais avoir pris connaissance du règlement intérieur
                        du club.
                    </p>
                    <p class="disclaimer-note">⚠ Texte provisoire — à remplacer par la version définitive validée par le président du club.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ── Signatures ── #}
            <div class="doc-section">
                <div class="doc-section-head">
                    <div class="doc-section-head-bar"></div>
                    <span class="doc-section-title">Signatures</span>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-section-body">
                    <div class="sign-grid">
                        <div class="sign-block">
                            <span class="sign-label">Signature du participant</span>
                            <div class="sign-area"></div>
                            <span class="sign-hint">Précéder de « Lu et approuvé »</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="sign-block">
                            <span class="sign-label">Signature de l'encadrant(e)</span>
                            <div class="sign-area"></div>
                            <span class="sign-hint">&nbsp;</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ── Pied de page ── #}
            <div class="doc-footer">
                <span class="doc-footer-text">Document provisoire · à archiver après signature</span>
                <span class="doc-footer-text">CHM Saleux · {{ seance.dateSeance|date('Y') }}</span>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <script nonce="{{ csp_nonce('script') }}">
        document.getElementById('btn-print').addEventListener('click', function () {
            window.print();
        });

        window.onload = function () {
            setTimeout(function () { window.print(); }, 500);
        };
    </script>

</body>
</html>
